                    <div>
                        <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Asisten AI Virtual Tutor Sejarah</h2>
                        <p class="text-xs text-amber-200">Tanya apa saja seputar Diakronik dan Sinkronik (Aktif 24/7)</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Chat Messages Body -->
                <div id="chat-messages" class="flex-grow p-6 overflow-y-auto space-y-4 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-amber-700 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">AI</div>
                        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 max-w-lg text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                            Halo! Saya Asisten AI Sejarah Anda. Ada yang ingin ditanyakan mengenai perbedaan berpikir diakronik dan sinkronik?
                        </div>
                    </div>
